# qwen3.8-27b-coding — Qwen3.8-27B tuned for local coding-agent use on GB10.
# Rationale for every value is in the optimization guide; all numbers measured
# on this box 2026-08-18.
FROM qwen3.8:27b

# The single most important change. ollama defaults num_ctx to 4096 regardless
# of the model, then silently context-shifts anything longer -- a 15.9k-token
# repo prompt is accepted, but the model only ever sees its tail.
# Measured: at 4096 it cannot answer a question about a constant declared at the
# top of a 10k-token file; at 32768 it answers correctly.
# KV cost is tiny here: this is a hybrid SSM model with only 16 attention
# layers, so q8_0 KV is ~136 MiB at 4k -> ~1.1 GiB at 32k.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Qwen3-family recommended sampling for non-thinking mode. Deterministic-ish
# without being degenerate; repeat_penalty 1.0 because penalising repetition
# corrupts code (indentation, repeated identifiers, boilerplate).
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0

# Don't let a long refactor get cut off mid-function.
PARAMETER num_predict -1
